@api = http://localhost:5080

### Пакет из двух замеров
POST {{api}}/api/telemetry/batch
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "tagId": 1, "timestamp": "2026-11-02T10:00:00Z", "value": 42.5, "quality": 1 },
  { "tagId": 2, "timestamp": "2026-11-02T10:00:00Z", "value": 17.1, "quality": 0 }
]

### Последний замер тега
GET {{api}}/api/tags/1/latest

### Последний достоверный замер (quality = Good)
GET {{api}}/api/tags/1/latest?goodOnly=true

### История за период
GET {{api}}/api/tags/1/history?from=2026-11-02T00:00:00Z&to=2026-11-03T00:00:00Z&limit=100

### Health check
GET {{api}}/health
